tion of the child's origin tag; a composition\n   918\t   that supplies none gives the child no secret, so the child can issue\n   919\t   no resource reference (fail closed).\"\n   920\t  [state module-name response]\n   921\t  (let [n (or (:origins state) 0)\n   922\t        origin (keyword (str (name (or (:origin state) :t0)) \".\" n))\n   923\t        registry (reduce (fn [r [m entry]]\n   924\t                           (module/assoc-module r m (dissoc entry :bindings)))\n   925\t                         (:modules state)\n   926\t                         (linked-entries (:modules state)))\n   927\t        source (:secret-source state)\n   928\t        child (module/spawn-module state\n   929\t                                   (:value (:image response))\n   930\t                                   {:modules registry,\n   931\t                                    :origin origin,\n   932\t                                    :ancestry (conj (vec (:ancestry state))\n   933\t                                                    module-name),\n   934\t                                    ;; the composition mints each task's\n   935\t                                    ;; secret (r10); without a source the\n   936\t                                    ;; child can issue no reference\n   937\t                                    :capability-secret\n   938\t                                    (when (fn? source) (source origin))})\n   939\t        child (reduce (fn [c [m entry]] (receive-module c m entry))\n   940\t                      child\n   941\t                      (linked-entries registry))]\n   942\t    [child (assoc state :origins (inc n))]))\n   943\t\n   944\t\n   945\t(defn- wake-installed\n   946\t  \"Move every `:install` wait entry naming `module-name` to the ready\n   947\t   queue, woken with `value`, or with `refusal` raised.\"\n   948\t  [state module-name value refusal]\n   949\t  (let [waiter? (fn [e]\n   950\t                  (and (= :install (:reason e