{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba test/yin/vm/linker_require_test.cljc | sed -n '185,230p;850,925p;1230,1335p'\"","aggregated_output":"   185\t\n   186\t\n   187\t;; =============================================================================\n   188\t;; The link pair and the stub responder\n   189\t;; =============================================================================\n   190\t\n   191\t(defn- link-pair\n   192\t  \"The link pair, and the directory of every stream the composition made,\n   193\t   by logical identity, which its attacher resolves.\"\n   194\t  []\n   195\t  {:request (tu/new-stream 64),\n   196\t   :response (tu/new-stream 64),\n   197\t   :streams (atom {})})\n   198\t\n   199\t\n   200\t(defn- composition\n   201\t  \"One task's composition over `pair`: the ring buffer, recorded so a\n   202\t   lowered stream reference (r9) can attach to it; a deterministic\n   203\t   capability secret, and a deterministic source minting each install\n   204\t   child's own (r10).\"\n   205\t  [pair]\n   206\t  (let [streams (:streams pair)]\n   207\t    {:primitives vm/primitives,\n   208\t     :modules (module/default-registry),\n   209\t     :make-stream (fn [capacity]\n   210\t                    (let [r (tu/make-stream capacity)]\n   211\t                      (swap! streams assoc (:dao.stream/identity r)\n   212\t                             (:dao.stream/handle r))\n   213\t                      r)),\n   214\t     :capability-secret tu/secret,\n   215\t     :secret-source (fn [origin] (str tu/secret \"/\" (name origin))),\n   216\t     :attach-stream (ringbuffer/make-attacher (fn [ident]\n   217\t                                                (get @streams ident))),\n   218\t     :link-request (:request pair),\n   219\t     :link-response (:response pair)}))\n   220\t\n   221\t\n   222\t(defn- responder\n   223\t  \"A stub linker over `pair`: `table` maps a module name to